{"id":"736e970754179718","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-thm-spectral-radius.md","title":"Spectral Radius Formula","display":"thm-spectral-radius — Spectral Radius Formula","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-spectral-radius","aliases":["58-thm-spectral-radius"],"display":"thm-spectral-radius — Spectral Radius Formula","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-spectral-radius.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-spectral-radius"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-spectral-radius</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-spectral-radius — Spectral Radius Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1f2a9a9bf39ac82d\" href=\"?note=1f2a9a9bf39ac82d\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-spectral-radius.md\">../batch03/58-df-spectral-radius.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|,1_{\\mathcal A})\">\\((\\mathcal A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|,1_{\\mathcal A})\\)</span> (complex unital Banach algebra) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathcal A\">\\(a\\in\\mathcal A\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Spectrum}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Spectrum}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SpectralRadius}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{SpectralRadius}_S\\)</span> (canonical spectrum and spectral-radius operators from the dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlg}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlg}_S\\)</span> (ambient predicate from dependency)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}radius} \\vdash \\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlg}_S(\\mathcal A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|,1_{\\mathcal A})\\land a\\in\\mathcal A\\to \\operatorname{SpectralRadius}_S(a;\\mathcal A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|,1_{\\mathcal A})=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\|a^n\\|^{1/n}=\\inf_{n\\geq1}\\|a^n\\|^{1/n}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}radius} \\vdash \\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlg}_S(\\mathcal A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|,1_{\\mathcal A})\\land a\\in\\mathcal A\\to \\operatorname{SpectralRadius}_S(a;\\mathcal A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|,1_{\\mathcal A})=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\|a^n\\|^{1/n}=\\inf_{n\\geq1}\\|a^n\\|^{1/n}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is Gelfand's formula; the complex unital Banach-algebra context makes the spectrum and unit explicit.</li>\n<li>The premise now reuses the five-place unital Banach-algebra predicate supplied by the spectral-radius dependency; the former two ambient predicate names had no common definition in the dependency graph.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-spectral-radius.md","status":"resolved","id":"1f2a9a9bf39ac82d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-spectral-radius.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(\\mathcal A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|,1_{\\mathcal A})","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathcal A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Spectrum}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SpectralRadius}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlg}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}radius} \\vdash \\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlg}_S(\\mathcal A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|,1_{\\mathcal A})\\land a\\in\\mathcal A\\to \\operatorname{SpectralRadius}_S(a;\\mathcal A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|,1_{\\mathcal A})=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\|a^n\\|^{1/n}=\\inf_{n\\geq1}\\|a^n\\|^{1/n}","display":true}],"bytes":1273,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4429","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-thm-spectral-radius.md|58-thm-spectral-radius]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["1f2a9a9bf39ac82d"]}